WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.360 --> 00:00:02.490
- So Quentin, obviously
you play one of the dancers

00:00:02.490 --> 00:00:04.470
in our show.
- Yes, yes. I play Otis.

00:00:04.470 --> 00:00:06.510
- [Kumail] What was it like
for you filming the routines?

00:00:06.510 --> 00:00:08.312
I mean, that you worked so hard for 'em.

00:00:08.312 --> 00:00:09.145
- Yeah, yeah.

00:00:09.145 --> 00:00:11.250
No, I mean, it was tough, obviously.

00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:13.230
Like, I have no dance background.

00:00:13.230 --> 00:00:15.750
So I had to do two months of choreography,

00:00:15.750 --> 00:00:18.690
two months of dance training
before we even started.

00:00:18.690 --> 00:00:20.637
Five days a week, hours every day.

00:00:20.637 --> 00:00:21.470
So, yeah.

00:00:21.470 --> 00:00:23.730
- And people don't know this,

00:00:23.730 --> 00:00:26.670
you were so buff coming into the show

00:00:26.670 --> 00:00:29.280
that we had to ask you
to stop working out.

00:00:29.280 --> 00:00:30.113
- [Quentin] Yes.

00:00:30.113 --> 00:00:32.850
- 'Cause you were making
all those guys look bad.

00:00:32.850 --> 00:00:34.830
- So I thought, you
know, the first iteration

00:00:34.830 --> 00:00:38.100
had the guys from Venice
Beach, these bodybuilders.

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:39.660
So when I got it, I just started lifting.

00:00:39.660 --> 00:00:41.070
Got the biggest I'd ever been.

00:00:41.070 --> 00:00:42.577
I got this call from Nora and she's like,

00:00:42.577 --> 00:00:44.700
"Hey, we saw the tape you sent in.

00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:47.116
Thank you so much. Could you
please never work out again?"

00:00:47.116 --> 00:00:48.600
(Kumail laughing)

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:49.433
And so, yeah, yeah.

00:00:49.433 --> 00:00:50.820
I had to drop about 20 pounds

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:53.028
before we actually
started filming and then-

00:00:53.028 --> 00:00:54.201
- [Annaleigh] Of muscle. Of muscle.

00:00:54.201 --> 00:00:55.034
- [Quentin] Yeah, of muscle-

00:00:55.034 --> 00:00:56.430
- [Annaleigh] Had to
drop 20 pounds of muscle.

00:00:56.430 --> 00:00:57.366
- [Murray] Yeah. Yeah.

00:00:57.366 --> 00:00:59.010
(audience wooing)

00:00:59.010 --> 00:01:02.370
- And him minus 20 pounds of
muscle still looks amazing.

00:01:02.370 --> 00:01:03.240
- Yeah.

00:01:03.240 --> 00:01:04.723
- [Kumail] You looks so good on the show.

00:01:04.723 --> 00:01:05.764
- Thank you. Thank you.
- Really-

00:01:05.764 --> 00:01:06.972
- [Audience Member] Take it off!

00:01:06.972 --> 00:01:08.460
(Murray and Annaleigh laughing)

00:01:08.460 --> 00:01:10.050
- This isn't actually the Chippendales.

00:01:10.050 --> 00:01:11.190
- They said take, "Take it off."

00:01:11.190 --> 00:01:13.680
- Tune into Hulu. You can
see me take it all off.

00:01:13.680 --> 00:01:16.590
- Yeah, go to Hulu. You can watch it now.

00:01:16.590 --> 00:01:17.700
All your dreams will come true.

00:01:17.700 --> 00:01:20.066
- Actually, it feels weird
seeing you in clothes.

00:01:20.066 --> 00:01:21.357
(Murray and Annaleigh laughing)

00:01:21.357 --> 00:01:22.190
I'm kidding.

00:01:22.190 --> 00:01:23.630
- So that's what he looks like.

